{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36472","headline":"钓翁 · 罗邺","name":"钓翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来往烟波非定居，生涯蓑褐外无余。\n闲垂两鬓任如鹤，只系一竿时得鱼。\n月浦扣船歌皎洁，雨蓬隈岸卧萧疎。\n行人误话金张贵，笑指北邙丘与墟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}